<title>USA: Carver Bancorp Inc Q3 shr flat.</title>
<headline>Carver Bancorp Inc Q3 shr flat.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended December 31</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.07   profit	 $0.07</p>
<p> Net profit		   152   profit	   140</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,171		    2,153</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.17   profit	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net loss		     369   profit	   483</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,167		    2,148</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Total assets at December 31, 1996, were $372.15 million versus $367.66 million at December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>First nine months of the 1997 fiscal year include a one-time assessment of $1.6 million to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Q4 1997 provision for loan losses was $51,254 vs $75,000.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
